## 3. **Top-Left Logo (Brand Mark)**

**File:** [packages/scaffold/templates/canvas-theme-editor/src/main.ts.tmpl](packages/scaffold/templates/canvas-theme-editor/src/main.ts.tmpl#L286-L300)

**Markup:**
```typescript
const brandMark = document.createElement("div");
brandMark.className = "canvas-rce-shell__brand-mark";
brandMark.innerHTML = PANTOKEN_ICON;  // SVG injected directly
```

**CSS Classes & Styling:** [app.css](packages/scaffold/templates/canvas-theme-editor/src/app.css#L49-L61)
```css
.canvas-rce-shell__brand-mark {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  width: 2rem;
  height: 2rem;
  border-radius: 0.625rem;
  background: var(--instui-color-background-brand, var(--instui-color-brand, #0a5dc2));
  color: var(--instui-color-text-on-color, white);
}
```

**Icon Source:**
`PANTOKEN_ICON` is imported from `@pantoken/tinymce` (line 87):
```typescript
import { PANTOKEN_ICON, ... } from "@pantoken/tinymce";
```

**Current State:**
- Appears in the header (`.canvas-rce-shell`) with text "Pantoken | Canvas Theme Editor"
- Brand color background with white foreground
- No light/dark glyph swapping — just a static SVG

**Light/Dark Glyph Pattern in App:**
The app *does* use icon swapping elsewhere for light/dark mode:
- **Preview scheme toggle** ([main.ts.tmpl:1105-1110](packages/scaffold/templates/canvas-theme-editor/src/main.ts.tmpl#L1105-L1110)):
  ```typescript
  previewSchemeToggle.classList.toggle("-icon-moon", !previewDarkOverride);
  previewSchemeToggle.classList.toggle("-icon-sun", previewDarkOverride);
  ```
  Uses `-icon-moon` for light, `-icon-sun` for dark mode.

- **Appearance mode icons** ([main.ts.tmpl:384](packages/scaffold/templates/canvas-theme-editor/src/main.ts.tmpl#L384)):
  ```typescript
  for (const [appearance, label, icon] of [
    ["system", "System", SunMedium],
    ["light", "Light", SunMedium],
    ["dark", "Dark", MoonStar],
  ] as const)
  ```
  Uses `SunMedium` for system/light, `MoonStar` for dark.

