## 4. **Side-by-Side / Column Layout**

**CSS File:** [packages/scaffold/templates/canvas-theme-editor/src/app.css](packages/scaffold/templates/canvas-theme-editor/src/app.css#L225-L280)

**Layout Control:**
```css
.content {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;  /* Default: stacked */
  gap: 0.5rem;
}

.content[data-layout="row"] {
  /* Row mode: side-by-side */
  /* No explicit rule here; flex-direction remains row once set inline */
}

.pane {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}

.editor-pane {
  flex: 1 1 0;
  min-height: 25rem;  /* Stacked mode max-height concept */
  min-width: 0;
}

.preview-pane {
  flex: 0 1 auto;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0;
  min-width: 0;
  min-height: 0;
  border: 2px solid var(--instui-color-stroke-base);
  border-radius: 10px;
}

.content[data-layout="row"] .preview-pane {
  flex: 1 1 0;  /* Equal width in row mode */
  align-self: flex-start;
}
```

**Width Control:**
- **Large (default):** Unconstrained, fills available space
- **Medium/Small:** Constrained via `PREVIEW_WIDTHS` ([main.ts.tmpl:1033-1037](packages/scaffold/templates/canvas-theme-editor/src/main.ts.tmpl#L1033-L1037)):
  ```typescript
  const PREVIEW_WIDTHS: Record<string, string> = {
    medium: "var(--instui-breakpoints-md)",  // Canvas-responsive breakpoint
    small: "var(--instui-breakpoints-sm)",
  };

  function applyPreviewWidth(): void {
    if (selectedPreviewWidth === "large") return;
    if (fullscreen) {
      previewFrame.style.maxWidth = PREVIEW_WIDTHS[selectedPreviewWidth];
    } else {
      previewPane.style.flex = "0 0 auto";
      previewPane.style.width = PREVIEW_WIDTHS[selectedPreviewWidth];
    }
  }
  ```

**Resize Handle:**
No explicit resize handle visible — layout is controlled by the preview-width picker buttons (monitor/tablet/phone icons) in the preview header.

**Preview Height Sizing:**
```css
#preview {
  border: 0 none;
  overflow: hidden;
  width: 100%;
  margin-inline: auto;
}

.preview-pane.-fullscreen #preview {
  flex: 1 1 auto;
  min-height: 0;
  overflow: auto;  /* Allow scroll in fullscreen */
}
```

Dynamic height managed via `ResizeObserver` + `MutationObserver` ([main.ts.tmpl:1122-1148](packages/scaffold/templates/canvas-theme-editor/src/main.ts.tmpl#L1122-L1148)):
```typescript
function resizePreviewFrame(): void {
  if (previewPane.classList.contains("-fullscreen")) {
    previewFrame.style.removeProperty("height");
    return;
  }
  const root = previewFrame.contentDocument?.documentElement;
  const body = previewFrame.contentDocument?.body;
  const style = getComputedStyle(body);
  const margins = Number.parseFloat(style.marginTop) + Number.parseFloat(style.marginBottom);
  const height = Math.ceil(Math.max(root.getBoundingClientRect().height, body.offsetHeight + margins));
  previewFrame.style.height = `${height + PREVIEW_BORDER_PX}px`;
}
```

**Layout Toggle Button:** [app.html:26-31](packages/scaffold/templates/canvas-theme-editor/src/app.html#L26-L31)
```html
<button type="button" id="layout-direction-toggle"
  class="instui-button -color-secondary -icon-rows-2"
  aria-pressed="false">
</button>
```

